<title>NEW ZEALAND: Sky City visitors ahead of projections.</title>
<headline>Sky City visitors ahead of projections.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1996-09-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sky City Ltd directors said on Tuesday visitor numbers to its Auckland casino were 36 percent ahead of projections at 1.9 million in the first five months of operation.</p>
<p>Subject to shareholder approval the directors have resolved to pay out 100 percent of profits, representing 15.5 cents a share final dividend this year, and propose to pay about 90 percent on an ongoing basis.</p>
</text>
